{78}{There were two eye-witnesses to the ascension of Mannox--two elves of  One was an elf named R'aan-Dar, and the other...what was his name...K'an Hua, I believe.  Their accounts of the incident were almost exactly the same, and both were beautifully written...}{There were two eye-witnesses to the ascension of Mannox--two elves of  One was an elf named R'aan-Dar, and the other...what was his name...K'an Hua, I believe.  Their accounts of the incident were almost exactly the same, and both were beautifully written...}{}{}{}{lf3 1}
