{85}{Almost all of the records concerning the life of the Great Saint have been lost over the years...very little is known about him, or what he did before he was...ahem...taken.  [A slight smirk.]  Of course, there are the usual insubstantial accounts of miracles.  [He seems to remember himself, straightening.]  And, of course, there's Alexander...}{Almost all of the records concerning the life of the Great Saint have been lost over the years...very little is known about him, or what he did before he was...ahem...taken.  [A slight smirk.]  Of course, there are the usual insubstantial accounts of miracles.  [He seems to remember himself, straightening.]  And, of course, there's Alexander...}{}{}{}{}
