{89}{No...I didn't know that.  That's quite a legacy.}{}{5}{}{91}{}
{91}{Yes, it is.  And there's no better man to bear it--Alexander is a saint in his own right.  There are few men I respect, my friend.  Alexander is a noble soul...do you know anything of him?}{Yes, it is.  And there's no better man to bear it--Alexander is a saint in his own right.  There are few men I respect, my friend.  Alexander is a noble soul...do you know anything of him?}{}{}{}{}
