{171}{I found something, but I don't know what it means...[Tell him.]}{}{5}{}{173}{}
{173}{Interesting.  It seems that the proverbial wool has been pulled over our eyes...but for what reason?  I suppose it could be that the early church elders believed that an ascension story might strengthen people's beliefs...but at the cost of another man's life?  I find that very difficult to believe...BUT!  I have found something that I believe may confirm that those remains are false...}{Interesting.  It seems that the proverbial wool has been pulled over our eyes...but for what reason?  I suppose it could be that the early church elders believed that an ascension story might strengthen people's beliefs...but at the cost of another man's life?  I find that very difficult to believe...BUT!  I have found something that I believe may confirm that those remains are false...}{}{}{}{}
