{193}{The southernmost tip of ANY land in Arcanum is the Isle of Thanatos...to the south of here.  I think that is where you next should go.  I might ask you a favor...if you have the time before you leave, perhaps you could uncover the truth behind Saint Mannox?  There are men here who would be interested in finding the responsible party...}{The southernmost tip of ANY land in Arcanum is the Isle of Thanatos...to the south of here.  I think that is where you next should go.  I might ask you a favor...if you have the time before you leave, perhaps you could uncover the truth behind Saint Mannox?  There are men here who would be interested in finding the responsible party...}{}{}{}{ru 2073, ss 17}
