{312}{Good god...no, no.  The reason it was so easy to believe that these were the remains of Nasrudin was because we thought they were in the right place...the southernmost tip of the MAINLAND.   But they're not!  He crossed the waters!  The southernmost tip of ANY land in Arcanum is on the Island of Thanatos...}{Good god...no, no.  The reason it was so easy to believe that these were the remains of Nasrudin was because we thought they were in the right place...the southernmost tip of the MAINLAND.   But they're not!  He crossed the waters!  The southernmost tip of ANY land in Arcanum is on the Island of Thanatos...}{}{}{}{ru 2073}
