{316}{Yes!  If you're looking for the remains of Nasrudin...that is the best place to start.  Listen, friend...you're not the brightest star in the sky, and it's really not your affair, but I know there's quite a few people around here who wouldn't mind getting to the bottom of this Mannox business.  If you happen to figure out what that message means, return here...}{Yes!  If you're looking for the remains of Nasrudin...that is the best place to start.  Listen, friend...you're not the brightest star in the sky,  and it's really not your affair, but I know there's quite a few people around here who wouldn't mind getting to the bottom of this Mannox business.  If you happen to figure out what that message means, return here...}{}{}{}{ss 17, gf2037 1}
